From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muthukumar <mk@verveflux.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Feb 2026 19:51:34 +0530
Subject: feat: add override hooks for 23 APIs (Batch 13)

Navigator.userAgent (ForBinding refactor), Geolocation (getCurrentPosition,
watchPosition, clearWatch), HTMLCanvasElement.toBlob, HTMLCanvasElement.getContext,
OffscreenCanvas.getContext, HTMLFormElement/HTMLInputElement/HTMLSelectElement
autocomplete, CacheStorage (open, has, delete, keys), FontAccess.queryLocalFonts,
ScreenOrientation (lock, unlock), ServiceWorkerContainer (register,
getRegistration, getRegistrations), Navigator.vibrate,
BaseAudioContext.createAnalyser (ForBinding refactor),
OfflineAudioContext.startRendering

